wlan: dump the ROMv4 patch area after the image download

The MCU accepts both ROMv4 patches over BTIF/STP (315 + 230 fragments
acked) and the WLAN image download succeeds, yet WIFI_START never sets
WCIR.READY.  One open question is whether the patch body actually lands
in the MCU memory: read back the patch region (0xf0078000 and
0xf0078020) right after the image download, next to the existing
"after-dl" dump of 0x000a5800.

Diagnostic only, no behaviour change.

